<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - AUG 18.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - AUG 18.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The Centre Party will elect a new chairman this weekend.</p>
<p>- The police department head said the economic police need money urgently to solve serious economic crimes.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
